OL,3,GNEWSA'Worst possible time' for parking
OL,4,Acharge increase
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn independent shop owner says plans to
OL,7,Fintroduce new parking charges in
OL,8,FDecember would be the "worst possible
OL,9,Ftime".
OL,11,FSomerset Council is considering new
OL,12,FSunday parking fees and sharp rises to
OL,13,Fweekday tariffs in some car parks, with
OL,14,Fa decision expected on the 23
OL,15,FSeptember.
OL,17,FSusie Thomas, who owns Rocket and Bird
OL,18,Fin Taunton, said she believed the
OL,19,Fproposals were about "making more money
OL,20,Fand not about making it fair throughout
OL,21,Fthe county".
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
