OL,3,GNEWSA'Worst possible time' for parking
OL,4,Acharge increase
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Richard Wilkins, who
OL,7,Foversees highways and transport at
OL,8,FSomerset Council, said said the
OL,9,Fproposals were aimed at creating a
OL,10,F"fair and consistent" parking system
OL,11,Facross the county and fees would be
OL,12,Fused to "support local economies".
